OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain clears the southeast by
OL,6,Fmidday, leaving a day of mostly dry
OL,7,Fand sunny spells in the south. Showers
OL,8,Fin the north, some being heavy with
OL,9,Fstrong winds. Chance of gales across
OL,10,FScotland with temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage for September.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers fade across central
OL,14,Fand eastern areas, leaving clear
OL,15,Fspells. Further west and north,
OL,16,Fshowers continue, with longer periods
OL,17,Fof rain in western and northern
OL,18,FScotland. Staying breezy, gales easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
