OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain moves into the west
OL,6,Fthrough the morning. Many eastern and
OL,7,Fsoutheastern areas staying mostly dry.
OL,8,FWindy with possible coastal gales in
OL,9,Fthe north and northwest. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average.
